  "composition_summary": "Preserved the volatile tail exactly (one user message, no assistant action invented). Drafted one class-22 pure-logic candidate pc-check-channel-list per the request. The body is module-scope Python with an if/else result assignment (no return), accepts an empty list as valid, uses inputs.get for presence, tests exact integer semantics (bool is not int), and returns {ok, channels} with the original list only when valid. No exceptions, imports, host calls, I/O or coercion. Kept the requested field names and bounds (0..255 inclusive) to the task's own contract; did not copy another example's names or requirements. No provider capabilities were observed (target_provider_metadata has null protocol_capabilities and null catalogue_revision), so no prompt repair was justified; the volatile tail is unchanged. The draft is an unapproved target-interface proposal only; Q1, behavioral validation and human Q2 precede activation.",
